  "name": "Orthogenic Plague",
  "type": "spell",
  "img": "modules/the-ninth-school/assets/artwork/spell-icons/orthogenic-plague.png",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You release a self-replicating orthogenic organism into a target creature. The organism rewrites the target's cellular structure, dealing 4d10 necrotic per round for 1 minute (Con save each round to end). Creatures slain by this spell rise as Orthogenic Zombies under your control &mdash; plant matter threading their bones, moving with unsettling symmetry. They retain no memories but maintain their combat statistics.</p><p><em>At 8th level: Damage increases to 5d10. At 9th: 6d10 and the save DC increases by 2.</em></p>",
